		"en": [
			"• Death Scythe Hell that appears in \"Mobile Suit GundamW Endless Waltz\". ■Uses XXX-G frame with high mobility. ■New gimmick installed in active cloak. It can naturally reproduce the flapping appearance and closed state. ■Marking is designed by Hajime Katoki. Molded product x 19, Foil Seal x 1, Marking Seal x 1, Gundam decal x 1, Assembly Manual"
